Error [jet.MissingWriteMarker]: `.next()` changes `items`, which has read access only
  --> tests/ui/iter_next_immutable_binding.jet:5:11
    |
  5 |     print(items.next())
    |           ^^^^^
 Why: This method edits the value it's called on, so its receiver needs write access
 Fix: Declare `items := ...`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0202
